  7 mpbid gcncfmappart.3 6 |- ( ph -> ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) e. ( U -cn-> RR ) )
  8 ssid |- U C_ U
  9 resmpt |- ( U C_ U -> ( ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) |` U ) = ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) )
  10 ax-mp 8 9 |- ( ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) |` U ) = ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) )
  11 a1i 10 |- ( ph -> ( ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) |` U ) = ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) )
  12 eqeltrd 11 7 |- ( ph -> ( ( x e. U |-> ( F ` x ) ) |` U ) e. ( U -cn-> RR ) )

