  2 mpbid gcncfbdd.4 1 |- ( ph -> F e. ( ( A [,] B ) -cn-> RR ) )
  3 ax-resscn |- RR C_ CC
  4 ssid |- CC C_ CC
  5 cncfss |- ( ( RR C_ CC /\ CC C_ CC ) -> ( ( A [,] B ) -cn-> RR ) C_ ( ( A [,] B ) -cn-> CC ) )
  6 mp2an 3 4 5 |- ( ( A [,] B ) -cn-> RR ) C_ ( ( A [,] B ) -cn-> CC )
