  2 syl2anc gdvrepart.2 gdvrepart.1 1 |- ( ph -> ( RR _D F ) : dom ( RR _D F ) --> RR )
  3 sseldd gdvrepart.3 gdvrepart.4 |- ( ph -> C e. dom ( RR _D F ) )
  4 ffvelcdmd 2 3 |- ( ph -> ( ( RR _D F ) ` C ) e. RR )

