      \ { C } ) ) = F <-> A. x e. ( U \ { C } ) ( ( G |` ( U \ { C } ) ) ` x ) = ( F ` x ) ) )
  17 syl2anc 9 10 16 |- ( ph -> ( ( G |` ( U \ { C } ) ) = F <-> A. x e. ( U \ { C } ) ( ( G |` (
      U \ { C } ) ) ` x ) = ( F ` x ) ) )
  18 mpbird 15 17 |- ( ph -> ( G |` ( U \ { C } ) ) = F )
  19 limcdif 3 |- ( ph -> ( G limCC C ) = ( ( G |` ( U \ { C } ) ) limCC C ) )
  20 oveq1d 18 |- ( ph -> ( ( G |` ( U \ { C } ) ) limCC C ) = ( F limCC C ) )
  21 eqtrd 19 20 |- ( ph -> ( G limCC C ) = ( F limCC C ) )
  22 eleqtrrd gcncfext.10 21 |- ( ph -> L e. ( G limCC C ) )
