  1 gdvatanres gdvatan.1 gdvatan.2 gdvatan.3 gdvatan.4 gdvatan.5 |- ( ph -> ( ( RR _D G ) |` U ) = ( x e. U |-> ( 1 / ( 1 + ( x ^ 2 ) ) ) ) )
